<br />
~hc~ #PROJECT#CRONTAB# "0 0 1 * *" ~/hc~<br />
<br />
!!!Chrestomathy<br />
<br />
This project is headed by [mailto:gregory.dyke@epfl.ch|Gregory Dyke].  The goal is to produce a collection of translated and original writings designed to show a wide sampling of a language. We need translations of texts generally a bit longer than the typical effort (1000-10000 words), and as wide a variety of texts and styles, from as many different source languages as possible. Original works in Lojban that exercise a variety of aspects of the language are even more important.<br />
<br />
~hc~ #END#PROJECT# ~/hc~<br />
