<br />
~hc~ #PROJECT#CRONTAB# "0 0 1 * *" ~/hc~<br />
<br />
!!!Lojbanic Phrasebook Project<br />
<br />
This project is run by [mailto:mugglesnsquibs@msn.com|Robert Griffin], and the goal is to produce a Survival Guide to Lojban, based on the WW II language guides given the common American soldier. Presents a minimal vocabulary, based on common basic needs, to help in developing a small active vocabulary in Lojban.<br />
<br />
If you were stranded in Lojbanistan, away from the nearest English speaker this is the minimal vocabulary you would need to get by.<br />
<br />
~hc~ #END#PROJECT# ~/hc~<br />
