!!!Newsletters<br />
<br />
[http://www.miranda.org/~jkominek/|Jay Kominek] has been charged with producing a new issue of the ((Frequently Asked Questions About Lojban|#JL|JL)) newsletter for board approval.<br />
<br />
((Frequently Asked Questions About Lojban|#JL|JL)) and ((Frequently Asked Questions About Lojban|#LK|LK)) will resume publication as soon as the ((Frequently Asked Questions About Lojban|#LLG|LLG)) address data base is brought up to date. Changes and additions were recorded on paper for around 6 years without being entered onto the computer, and we are obliged to account to people for their money balances.<br />
<br />
