!!!Lojban Parser<br />
<br />
((Robin Lee Powell)) is creating [http://digitalkingdom.org/~rlpowell/hobbies/lojban/grammar/index.html|yet another software parser] that can parse lojban text, this one using Parsing Expression Grammars.<br />
<br />
!!!!Project Report As Of 28 Dec 2005<br />
<br />
The parser basically works, and I'd love to see more people using it and [mailto:rlpowell@digitalkingdom.org|letting me know what they think].<br />
<br />
