!!!The Legend of Zelda Translation<br />
<br />
[mailto:rizen@surreality.us|Theodore Reed] is working on a lojban localization of the classic NES game, ((The Legend of Zelda)).<br />
<br />
!!!!Project Report As Of 01 Aug 2004<br />
<br />
I've translated just about everything, but hit a road block when it comes to the method by which the game stores colored text data. I could make a translated version, but the opening story would be somewhat unreadable. Also, I'd need an artist to redraw the main screen, since it's in English.<br />
