!!!Parliamentary Rules<br />
<br />
[http://wiki.lojban.org/index.php?xod|xod] heads the committee on creating Lojban terms for parliamentary actions. ((Mark Shoulson|Mark Shoulson)) is on the committee.<br />
<br />
!!!!Report as of September 2002<br />
<br />
 I am actively working on it as I read and learn the Standard Parliamentary Rules.<br />
